@startuml 011-technological-flow
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam shadownding false

title AdriaBOX - Python Library Dependencies and Technology Middleware Flow

box "Tenant User Space Pipeline" #White
participant "http_client.py\n(requests.Session)" as HTTP
participant "crypto.py\n(PyCryptography Engine)" as Crypto
end box

box "Metadata Control Plane Services" #White
participant "server.py\n(Flask Router)" as Server
participant "manager.py\n(PyJWT Core)" as JWT
participant "db.py\n(sqlite3 Driver Engine)" as DB
end box

[-> HTTP: Initiate login handshake
activate HTTP
HTTP -> Server: HTTP POST /login (Payload parameters JSON)
activate Server

Server -> DB: execute select row query via context handler
activate DB
note over DB: conn.row_factory = sqlite3.Row\nConverts records to object map contexts
DB --> Server: yield matching credential structures
deactivate DB

Server -> Server: verify password hash via Werkzeug\n[pbkdf2:sha256 matching primitives]

Server -> JWT: generate_token(username, scope_role)
activate JWT
note over JWT: Encodes token claims using HMAC-SHA256 signature\nSets 24-hour expiration threshold (exp)
JWT --> Server: return cryptographically signed JWT string
deactivate JWT

Server --> HTTP: HTTP 200 OK (Deliver JWT token value)
deactivate Server

HTTP -> Crypto: derive_key(password, salt=username)
activate Crypto
note over Crypto: Executes 100,000 PBKDF2HMAC iterations\nOutputs 32-Byte key string for AES-256-CTR
Crypto --> HTTP: Key derived in local workspace (Zero-Knowledge)
deactivate Crypto
deactivate HTTP
@enduml
